    <worksheet name='Helper 1'>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='Custom SQL Query (sandbox_rutuja)' name='federated.0klddfr1hv5ctl155qmwe17fio9k' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.0klddfr1hv5ctl155qmwe17fio9k'>
            <column-instance column='[total_orders_bot]' derivation='Sum' name='[sum:total_orders_bot:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='total orders bot' datatype='integer' name='[total_orders_bot]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='label'>
            <format attr='text-align' scope='cols' value='center' />
            <format attr='vertical-align' scope='cols' value='center' />
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Shape' />
            <mark-sizing mark-sizing-setting='marks-scaling-off' />
            <encodings>
              <lod column='[federated.0klddfr1hv5ctl155qmwe17fio9k].[sum:total_orders_bot:qk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'><![CDATA[<[Parameters].[Date Granularity (copy)]> ]]></run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>vs </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontsize='12'><![CDATA[<[Parameters].[Metric 1 (copy)_3640667775680610307]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular'>- The filters are pre-selected since HeroBot is enabled for specific CCRs in specific entities</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular'>- If you select all the Issue types and all the countries, the numbers for Agent Chat would be inflated and it would give misleading results.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular'>- Always choose the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' italic='true'>Management entity</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular'>  first  then &gt;&gt; </run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' italic='true'>country</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular'>  &gt;&gt; correct </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' italic='true'>I</run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' italic='true'>ssue type</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular'> &gt;&gt; </run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' italic='true'>week</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular'>  to see the correct numbers </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='12'><![CDATA[% Diff between <[Parameters].[Date Granularity (copy)]>  & ]]></run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontsize='12'><![CDATA[<[Parameters].[Metric 1 (copy)_3640667775680610307]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Regular'>- Interpretation  of the chart : How Bot (metric 2) is performing against Agent chat (metric 1) in terms of   optimization Metric i.e. Avg reorders 5D)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Regular'>- The Average line would give the average across the selected period of time.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Regular'>- You can coose created_date and week to check the overall averge of the % difference  </run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='shape' value='Bug Tracking/light.png' />
                <format attr='size' value='2' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
